    "name": "Whimsical Heroes",
    "steam_appid": 1683750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.poster.avif?t=1749499932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.webm?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.mp4?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a land once flowing with milk and honey, resources suddenly began to run out. Sensing the impending end of the world as they knew it, the three heroes embark on a journey through unknown lands to uncover the mystery behind this life-sustaining energy crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat your foes in tactical, turn-based battles set on a hexagonal grid</strong>. Lead a party of cartoon heroes - the brave bean explorer, the fluffy cat defender, and the onion musician from distant realm - through a series of adventures in Whimsical Heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse tactical turn-based combat</strong> - Engage in a variety of battles with a wide range of characters, bosses, traps, special objects, reinforcement, and events at crucial moments in battle that make each encounter unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead a party of Whimsical Heroes</strong> - Each hero has a unique set of skills and roles within the team, offering exciting tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet allies and new companions</strong> - Companions will join your Camp, allowing you to expand it with new structures and providing powerful skills in next battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your camp</strong> - Your Camp is a safe haven for your heroes, where you can develop both your heroes and companions and purchase new artifacts for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Influence the fate of your expedition</strong> - The world of Whimsical Heroes isn't just about battles. It also features special events that require decision-making, sometimes leading to the discovery of new secret places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique artistic style</strong> - Immerse yourself in a world filled with cats, cheeky cucumbers, talented onions, and various other whimsical creatures. Explore what the world of Whimsical Heroes has to offer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.poster.avif?t=1749499932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.webm?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.mp4?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story and Adventure Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the game's narrative, that allows you to explore the game mechanics and learn about the fates of the main characters and the entire land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventure Mode (Inspired by Roguelike systems)</strong>: Choose three heroes and travel through a land that looks different with each playthrough. Heroes will acquire new skills and encounter various characters, offering fresh challenges every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.poster.avif?t=1749499932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.webm?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/3d83cbcd520d7bf2f57d65b398e06489.mp4?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a land once flowing with milk and honey, resources suddenly began to run out. Sensing the impending end of the world as they knew it, the three heroes embark on a journey through unknown lands to uncover the mystery behind this life-sustaining energy crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat your foes in tactical, turn-based battles set on a hexagonal grid</strong>. Lead a party of cartoon heroes - the brave bean explorer, the fluffy cat defender, and the onion musician from distant realm - through a series of adventures in Whimsical Heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse tactical turn-based combat</strong> - Engage in a variety of battles with a wide range of characters, bosses, traps, special objects, reinforcement, and events at crucial moments in battle that make each encounter unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead a party of Whimsical Heroes</strong> - Each hero has a unique set of skills and roles within the team, offering exciting tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet allies and new companions</strong> - Companions will join your Camp, allowing you to expand it with new structures and providing powerful skills in next battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your camp</strong> - Your Camp is a safe haven for your heroes, where you can develop both your heroes and companions and purchase new artifacts for them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Influence the fate of your expedition</strong> - The world of Whimsical Heroes isn't just about battles. It also features special events that require decision-making, sometimes leading to the discovery of new secret places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique artistic style</strong> - Immerse yourself in a world filled with cats, cheeky cucumbers, talented onions, and various other whimsical creatures. Explore what the world of Whimsical Heroes has to offer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.poster.avif?t=1749499932\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.webm?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683750/extras/e646905827df4fa42bc4a639799baef4.mp4?t=1749499932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story and Adventure Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the game's narrative, that allows you to explore the game mechanics and learn about the fates of the main characters and the entire land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventure Mode (Inspired by Roguelike systems)</strong>: Choose three heroes and travel through a land that looks different with each playthrough. Heroes will acquire new skills and encounter various characters, offering fresh challenges every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Gather your party, set up camp, and step into a fantasy world brimming with silly creatures, unexpected allies, and strategic turn-based battles. You\u2019ll grow your team of heroes, master and learn new skills, and meet tons of adorable characters along the way.",
